y related to the import, and not to the baking itself. The number of errors is equal to the number of exr files.\n\nThis is an unrelated issue that should be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100778","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2560384453/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2562013265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2562013265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2562013265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YtThR","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-25T22:30:46Z","updated_at":"2024-12-25T22:32:58Z","body":"Could you try exporting this project to your phone and posting the results? [compat-hdr-comp-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18247348/compat-hdr-comp-test.zip)\n\nFor reference, this is how it should look like:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b634bb2c-6d87-4dae-a8a4-6dd46b5752ee)\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2562013265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564487742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2564487742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2564487742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y2vo-","user":{"login":"SkanerSoft","id":13809475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODA5NDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13809475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft","html_url":"https://github.com/SkanerSoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-28T21:39:03Z","updated_at":"2024-12-28T21:39:03Z","body":"I'm sorry, I'm a little sick. I'll do everything in a couple of days!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564487742/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565622442","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2565622442","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2565622442,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y7Eqq","user":{"login":"SkanerSoft","id":13809475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODA5NDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13809475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft","html_url":"https://github.com/SkanerSoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-30T15:26:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T15:53:40Z","body":"@BlueCube3310 \nI'm finally at home with a computer! I checked the export on my phone, and this is the result.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96f2b2f4-6d3a-434e-b21a-c6471e130b57)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565622442/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565937088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2565937088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2565937088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y8RfA","user":{"login":"BlueCube3310","id":53150244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTUwMjQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53150244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310","html_url":"https://github.com/BlueCube3310","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlueCube3310/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-30T21:32:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T21:32:17Z","body":"Thank you for checking! Now I think I know the cause:\n\nIt looks like your phone doesn't support the HDR variant of ASTC. This is pretty common, according to https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/displayextensiondetail.php?extension=VK_EXT_texture_compression_astc_hdr on avarage only 50% of mobile devices support it, the default ASTC is more widely supported.\n\nThere was a bug in the ASTC HDR detection code that always reported it as available, it was fixed recently by #100822. #100848 and #100856 should make sure it gets decompressed at runtime and show up as normal","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565937088/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566365765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2566365765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2566365765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y96JF","user":{"login":"SkanerSoft","id":13809475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODA5NDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13809475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft","html_url":"https://github.com/SkanerSoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T11:24:58Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T11:24:58Z","body":"Thanks! I will keep an eye on the situation, after receiving the update I will write here!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566365765/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567649343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100644#issuecomment-2567649343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100644","id":2567649343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZCzg_","user":{"login":"ArtyIF","id":8017858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTc4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8017858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtyIF","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-02T11:43:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-02T12:15:55Z","body":"There's the same bug when exporting to the web, the texture needed just doesn't export. However, the web platform *does* seem to support the needed format, as replacing the .pck file with a file exported to a desktop platform fixes the issue.\n\nEDIT: another workaround (if you're only going to support desktop platforms I guess) is to add a `bptc` feature by typing it into the \"Custom (comma-separated)\" field in the Features tab of the web's export settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2567649343/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]